# Face matching & media API

## Client matching
- Library: `@vladmandic/face-api` (CDN models).
- Compare euclidean distance of face descriptors; keep match threshold strict enough to limit false positives (HSF used ~0.5).
- Support live camera auto-capture and selfie upload; group photos = any face in image can match.

## Uploads (organizer)
- Compress/resize client-side before upload when large (e.g. max edge ~1920).
- Upload in small batches; return success before long email fan-out.
- Member “photos ready” emails must be **background** (do not block upload response).
- Last batch may notify; intermediate batches `notify=0`.

## Delete downloaded photos (not “clear history”)
- `DELETE …/downloads` means: delete **files** that anyone downloaded, scrub matches, notify downloaders.
- **Keep** `downloads.json` / Who-downloaded table unchanged.
- Erase-all-photos is separate (all files in event).

## Photos list fields for admin UI
- Include `anyone_downloaded`, `download_count`, `uploaded_at` so blur/filter/sort work.
